{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/poteto/status/2087977008253071816","id":"2087977008253071816","text":"worktrees are dead. cloud agents are the future.\n\nthey've allowed me to massively orchestrate swarms of agents, all with their own computer. it's how i've been able to trust that my agents are actually doing what i want them to, because they can run their code, take videos and screenshots, and interact with UIs the same way users do.\n\ncloud agents + pstack is the reason why i'm able to ship thousands of PRs a month with high confidence. spawn a verification /swarm of Grok 4.6 agents to \"fuzz\" every stack of PRs and you'll be able to let your agents merge their own work while you sleep!\n\nalthough i miss writing the code myself, the combination of using @bot, @cursor_ai, and the speed, intelligence, and efficiency of Grok 4.6 makes building so much fun. the future of coding is really starting to look more like playing starcraft!","raw_text":{"text":"worktrees are dead. cloud agents are the future.\n\nthey've allowed me to massively orchestrate swarms of agents, all with their own computer. it's how i've been able to trust that my agents are actually doing what i want them to, because they can run their code, take videos and screenshots, and interact with UIs the same way users do.\n\ncloud agents + pstack is the reason why i'm able to ship thousands of PRs a month with high confidence. spawn a verification /swarm of Grok 4.6 agents to \"fuzz\" every stack of PRs and you'll be able to let your agents merge their own work while you sleep!\n\nalthough i miss writing the code myself, the combination of using @bot, @cursor_ai, and the speed, intelligence, and efficiency of Grok 4.6 makes building so much fun. the future of coding is really starting to look more like playing starcraft!","display_text_range":[0,838],"facets":[{"type":"mention","indices":[660,664],"original":"bot","id":"2085838061347217408"},{"type":"mention","indices":[666,67